 fillblank-option-15' index='3' name='fbo-903105-3' data-testid='fillblank-select-903105-3'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-903105-3'></option><option value=\"create\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903105-3-create'>create</option><option value=\"reduce\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903105-3-reduce'>reduce</option></select></span> </strong>new technology all the time to make life easier and more connected.</p>\n<p>Nam: It&#8217;s incredible how technology is changing our world. I can&#8217;t wait to see what comes next!</p>",
